<component>
    <CaseDocPage
        title={t("case.select.title")}
        description="Select 是 RML 的下拉选择器组件。通过 ref + items 或 value 双向绑定使用，支持 placeholder、cleanable、appearance、menu-width、menu-max-h、size 等属性。on-change 在选择确认时触发回调。"
        code-rml={rml_sample}
        code-rust={rust_sample}>
        <template slot="demo">
            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>1. 基础用法 + on-change 事件</h3>
                <p>通过 ref 引用选择器，items 绑定提供选项列表。选择后触发 on-change 回调。</p>
                <p>选中值：{selected_value}</p>
                <Select ref="basic_select" items={basic_items} on-change={on_basic_change} />
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>2. placeholder + cleanable</h3>
                <p>placeholder 设置占位文本，cleanable 启用清除按钮（默认关闭）。</p>
                <Select ref="cleanable_select" items={city_items} placeholder="请选择城市" cleanable on-change={on_city_change} />
                <p>选中城市：{selected_city}</p>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>3. appearance=false + menu-width/menu-max-h</h3>
                <p>appearance 默认 true，设为 false 移除边框与背景。menu-width/menu-max-h 控制下拉菜单宽度与最大高度。</p>
                <Select ref="minimal_select" items={lang_items} appearance="false" menu-width="240px" menu-max-h="200px" on-change={on_lang_change} />
                <p>选中语言：{selected_lang}</p>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>4. 尺寸 size</h3>
                <p>size 属性设置尺寸：xsmall / small / medium / large。点击按钮循环切换尺寸。</p>
                <p>当前尺寸：{size_label}</p>
                <div class="button-row">
                    <Button label="切换尺寸" on-click={on_cycle_size} />
                    <Select ref="sized_select" items={basic_items} size={size_value} />
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>5. value 双向绑定</h3>
                <p>value 与 items 配合实现双向绑定（无需 ref / on-change）。ViewModel 字段变更会更新选中项，用户选择会写回字段。</p>
                <p>绑定值：{bound_fruit}</p>
                <Select items={basic_items} value={bound_fruit} placeholder="请选择水果" cleanable />
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>API</h3>
                <Table columns={api_columns} rows={api_rows} bordered />
            </div>
        </template>
    </CaseDocPage>
</component>
